        "original_id": "82536024-190f-5907-b761-c49b370e56cd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Walter Murch, Gill Dennis, Paul Maslansky, David Naughton, Stephen Furst, Maggie Roswell, David Shire, Norman Gimbel\n- Films: Return to Oz, Midnight Madness\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Works: It Goes Like It Goes, Baby, Closer Than Ever, Starting Here, Starting Now\n\nFacts:\n- Midnight Madness is a 1980 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions and starring David Naughton, Stephen Furst, and Maggie Roswell.\n- Return to Oz is a 1985 fantasy adventure film directed and written by Walter Murch, co-written by Gill Dennis, and produced by Paul Maslansky.\n- David Shire composed the score for the 1985 film Return to Oz.\n- David Shire also wrote the stage musical scores for Baby, Closer Than Ever, and Starting Here, Starting Now.\n- It Goes Like It Goes is a song written by David Shire and Norman Gimbel.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
